# Bundle patch for @playform/plugin-dsh-factory.
# The FACTORY is a SERVICE-PROVIDER bundle: it registers nothing observable on
# its own — loading it makes the `pluginFactory` service available on the
# context so the governance flavors (the package.json governor, the package.json
# pinner, the Cargo.toml governor) can consume it. New entries are declared
# with `insert:` (docs/user/develop/basic/publish.md) — a bare `id:` row
# PATCHES an existing entry and the loader rejects unknown ids with
# 'entry "…" not found'. Activated when the profile's package.json lists the
# package in dsh.profile.bundles AND the app is restarted (bundle layers
# compose at host boot). A file: dependency alone is NOT activation.
# The class plugin (`export default class PluginFactory extends Service`)
# declares `static inject = ["fs"]` and registers itself as `pluginFactory`
# via `super(ctx, "pluginFactory")` — no Config schema, no config row needed.
- insert:
      - id: plugin-dsh-factory
        name: "@playform/plugin-dsh-factory"
        config: {}
